      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CAPTAIN PINS NZ (1) is a newcomer to the Seaton Grima yard from Victoria where he had a series of tough draws, managing to come from the back row to win four back at Charlton. Hasn't raced for more than a month but the ace draw gives him the chance to kick off for the new stable with a win. ULTIMATE EMPIRE (3) has had two runs this prep without filling a placing but showed good improvement here last time, finishing less than 4 metres away from the winner in fourth. Fitter again and has a decent draw. CREDULOUS (5) appreciated the class drop from the city when coming from a similar barrier to win in her first visit to this venue last time out. MILLI ME (2) gets her best draw of the campaign so far. Won her lone try at this distance and is proven third-up so could be ready to show more.",
